      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "1 命题"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b3",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "definition",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        300,
        665,
        410
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "在初中时已经知道，用自然语言、符号或式子表达，且可以判断其真假的语句叫做命题（proposition）. 命题通常用陈述句表述. 其含义判断为真的命题叫做真命题，判断为假的命题叫做假命题. 例如，“4 能被 2 整除”是真命题，“3 能被 2 整除”是假命题."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b4",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        420,
        665,
        465
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "例 1 下列语句哪些是命题？如果是命题，那么它们是真命题还是假命题？为什么？"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b5",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        470,
        665,
        645
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "(1) 个位数字是 5 的自然数能被 5 整除；",
            "(2) 凡直角三角形都相似；",
            "(3) 请起立；",
            "(4) 若两个角互为补角，则这两个角不相等；",
            "(5) 若两个三角形的三组对应边相等，则这两个三角形全等；",
            "(6) 你是高一学生吗？",
            "(7) $x>3$."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b6",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        650,
        665,
        695
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "解 语句(3)(6)(7)不是命题；语句(1)(2)(4)(5)是命题，其中语句(1)(5)是真命题，语句(2)(4)是假命题."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b7",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        700,
        665,
        760
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "(1) 这是一个真命题. 因为个位数字是 5 的自然数可写成 $10k+5$ 的形式（$k \notin \text{N}$），而 $10k+5=5(2k+1)$，它总能被 5 整除，所以个位数字是 5 的自然数能被 5 整除."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b8",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        765,
        665,
        830
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "(2) 因为三个角分别为 $90^\text{o}$、$45^\text{o}$、$45^\text{o}$ 的直角三角形与三个角分别为 $90^\text{o}$、$60^\text{o}$、$30^\text{o}$ 的直角三角形是不相似的，所以“凡直角三角形都相似”是一个假命题."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b9",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        835,
        665,
        855
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "(3) “请起立”无法判定真假，它不是一个命题."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p20_b10",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "example",
      "bbox": [
        95,
        860,
        665,
        920
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "(4) 取一个角为 $90^\text{o}$，另一个角也为 $90^\text{o}$，它们是互补的，同时它们也是相等的，所以“若两个角互为补角，则这两个角不相等”是一个假命题."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
